  aciklama:
  - "K\u0131z\u0131ll\u0131\u011F\u0131 siyah beyaz telvelerden dahi kendini belli
    eden bir g\xFCne\u015F var fal\u0131nda. Bu g\xFCne\u015Fin senin i\xE7in \xF6nemi
    \u015Fu {{isim}}; sen bat\u0131yor san\u0131yorsun, fakat tam tersi, do\u011Fuyor...
    Bu g\xFCne\u015F, e\u015Finin ard\u0131ndan sonland\u0131 diye d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    a\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda mutlulu\u011Fu yeniden yakalayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n
    i\u015Fareti. \xC7ok net g\xF6z\xFCken bu yans\u0131malar\u0131n alt\u0131nda
    ise iki ki\u015Fi belirmi\u015F. Erkek, kad\u0131na b\xFCy\xFCklerinden yadigar
    oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCm, baklalar\u0131 ya da taneleri
    olan bir kolye, zincir ya da bileklik uzat\u0131yor. Telveler, bu birlikteli\u011Fin
    hay\u0131rl\u0131 ve baki olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 f\u0131s\u0131ld\u0131yor."
